  "description": "With a name like Richard Huge, you know this boss is trouble. He thinks his seniority gives him free reign to do as he pleases, including getting handsy with his female employees. He’s especially fond of one coworker in particular, the young and hot Dohee. Dohee wants nothing to do with the boss but when Mr. Huge, or Director Dick as he’s known around the office, finds out Dohee’s dark secret, she’s left with few options but to do as he commands. There has to be a way out… Who or what can save Dohee from all this office trouble?\n\n(Source: Lezhin X)",
